AnimeDubsLibrary

This product fetches and utilizes external datasets.

When using the `DataSource.MyDubList` configuration, the data is sourced from MyDubList.
* MyDubList (https://mydublist.com)
* MyDubList dataset is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0) license.
* CC BY 4.0 License Terms: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

When using the `DataSource.MalDubs` configuration, the data is sourced from MAL-Dubs.
* MAL-Dubs (https://github.com/MAL-Dubs/MAL-Dubs)
